# Everything in this repo is stored with LF endings.
# Windows editors and PowerShell redirects rewrite files as CRLF, which turned a
# no-op into a 608-line phantom diff across 16 armour files during S1. The
# migration repo got this fix on 2026-09-06; this repo should have had it the
# same day. Normalize on the way in so it cannot happen again.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mul binary
*.idx binary
*.uop binary
